  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Post-Pandemic COVID-19 and Outbreak response: Sustaining the expansion of the Overseas Health Assessment and Management of U.S. - Bound Refugees, Non-Immigrant Visa Applicants and other Migrant Populations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is part of IOM&apos;s overall work with CDC to improve the health of migrants undergoing resettlement to the United States of America and protect the health of their receiving communities. It aims to strengthen the capacity to prevent, detect, investigate and respond to COVID-19 and other outbreaks of public health significance through various methods.</narrative>
  </description>
